flowchart TB
    accTitle: 报名用例的源代码依赖
    accDescr: API 依赖报名用例，用例依赖领域规则和存储接口。PostgreSQL 适配器实现业务侧的存储接口；用例不直接依赖具体适配器。
    API["API · HTTP 适配器"] --> USE["service · 报名用例"]
    USE --> DOMAIN["domain · 报名规则"]
    USE --> PORT["EnrollmentStore\n业务侧的存储接口"]
    DB["DB · PostgreSQL 适配器"] -.->|"实现接口"| PORT
    classDef domain fill:#fff3be,stroke:#b6a355,color:#272722
    classDef contract fill:#eaf2ea,stroke:#7f9b7f,color:#272722
    class DOMAIN domain
    class PORT contract
